-- Harley alt route (Mage first, any class). Written for the Harley pack (GPLv3); level-20 training steps carried over from the Bethink-based Redridge chapter.
Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[N 20-21 Ashenvale (Harley)]
[D Kerlonian's escort to Maestra's Post, the Tower of Althalaxx and Bathran's Haunt, level-20 training by boat to Stormwind, then Astranaar's lake, Raene's search and the Zoram Strand hunts, with an optional Blackfathom Deeps clear. Ends in Stormwind.]
[GA Alliance,Softcore]
[NX 21-22 Redridge Mountains (Harley)]
[A Mage] [O] Talents: At 20, take Ice Lance. At 21, Frost Channeling 1/3. The MageKit talent button (/mk talents) shows the next pick.
[A Mage] [OC] Rotation: Frostbolt, Frostbolt, then Ice Lance or Fire Blast to finish. Frost Nova when they reach you and Ice Lance the frozen target. Blizzard is for grouped pulls with Frost Nova ready. Mana Shield only in emergencies; Evocation when you are dry.
[A Priest] [O] Talent points: Twin Disciplines 3/5 at 21.
[A Warlock] [O] Joining the route at 20 (for example after Deadmines)? In /lime pick 20-21 Ashenvale (Harley). If you are in Stormwind, do this chapter's level-20 training and Gakin stops first, then take the boat to Auberdine.
[A Warlock] [O] Tick the Darkshore turn-ins you never picked up (The Tower of Althalaxx, Therylune's Escape, Unrequited Love) to skip them. Abandon Westfall or Redridge quests you will not finish; completed quests such as Deadmines skip themselves.
[A Warlock] [O] By 20 you should know Summon Imp and Voidwalker, Demon Skin, Shadow Bolt, Immolate, Corruption, Bane of Agony, Curse of Weakness, Curse of Recklessness, Life Tap, Fear, Drain Soul, Drain Life, Health Funnel, Searing Pain, Unending Breath, Create Healthstone and Create Soulstone. Learn anything missing at the level-20 stop.
[A Warlock] [O] Grimoires by 20 (Spackle Thornberry, Stormwind 39.53,84.53): Imp Blood Pact II, Firebolt III, Fire Shield I and Phase Shift; Voidwalker Sacrifice I and Consume Shadows I. Buy any you skipped at the same stop.
[A Warlock] [O] Talents: At 20, Unholy Power 1/5 (Demonology). At 21, Unholy Power 2/5. The WarlockKit talent button (/wk talents) shows the next pick.
[A Warlock] [OC] Rotation: Bane of Agony and Corruption on the pull, Immolate if it will live, then wand. Drain Life when you take damage, Life Tap when health is full. Voidwalker tanks; Fear a second add.
[A Warlock] [OC] Shards: end kills with Drain Soul until you hold 5+ Soul Shards. Keep one Healthstone and a Soulstone on yourself at all times; /wk shards 5 warns when you run low.
[A Warlock] [OC] Group or elite steps: send the Voidwalker in first and let it hold aggro, Fear any add, and Sacrifice it when it is about to die. Without a group, skip the optional [O] group steps.
[XP20] Start in Auberdine at 20. Keep The Tower of Althalaxx, Therylune's Escape and Unrequited Love.
[OC] Ashenvale is contested: Horde players use Zoram'gar on the western coast. Stay clear of the outpost, the Thistlefur furbolgs north of the road and the level 24+ Foulweald camps east of Astranaar.
Follow the road south through Darkshore to Kerlonian Evershade, asleep beside Onu's grove. He can take a long time to respawn; skip his escort if he is missing.
Accept [QA5321]; the escort has a 20-minute timer. [O]
Open Kerlonian's Chest beside him for the Horn of Awakening for [QC5321,1]. [O]
[UI13536] Escort Kerlonian south into Ashenvale and to Maestra's Post, blowing the Horn of Awakening whenever he falls asleep. Ambushes come from the road, so walk beside it for [QC5321]. [O]
Turn in [QT5321] to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post. [O]
Turn in [QT967] to Delgren the Purifier, then accept [QA970].
Accept [QA1010] from Orendil Broadleaf.
Collect a Glowing Soul Gem from the Dark Strand cultists east of Maestra's Post for [QC970]. Pull casters one at a time.
Collect five Bathran's Hair from the bundles around Bathran's Haunt to the north for [QC1010]. Clear the Dark Strand guards before looting.
Turn in [QT970], then accept [QA973]; Ilkrud's tome is an optional group hunt later.
Turn in [QT1010], then accept [QA1020].
Follow the road southeast to Astranaar.
[G34.41,48.00 Ashenvale] [P Astranaar] Take Daelyshia's flight point.
[G36.99,49.22 Ashenvale] [S Astranaar] Bind with Innkeeper Kimlya; the training trip and the lake loops return here.
Turn in [QT1020] to Pelturas Whitemoon, then accept [QA1033].
Accept [QA1008] from Shindrell Swiftfire.
Accept [QA991] from Raene Wolfrunner.
[G34.41,48.00 Ashenvale] [F Auberdine] Fly to Auberdine, then take the Stormwind boat for level-20 training.
[A Priest] [G49.53,44.60 Stormwind City] [T] At High Priestess Laurena, learn Inner Fire II, Renew III, Flash Heal I and Devouring Plague I (21s each), plus Dispel Magic if you skipped it at 18.
[A Priest] [G49.53,44.60 Stormwind City] [T] [O] If gold allows, also learn Fade II, Fear Ward, Holy Fire I, Mind Soothe I and Shackle Undead I (21s each). They can wait.
[A Priest,Human] Accept [QA5676], then turn in [QT5676] and learn Feedback from High Priestess Laurena.
[A Priest,Mage,Warlock] [O] In the Mage Quarter, craft the level-20 Pristine and Filigreed Pristine pieces, train professions, and make the Greater Magic Wand if you have the Enchanting skill and no better wand.
[A Priest,Mage,Warlock] [V] Repair and restock. [O] Check the Auction House for a wand upgrade if you still use your first wand.
[A Warrior,Hunter,Paladin,Druid] [G63.88,69.09 Stormwind City] [T] [LE Polearms 1-] [O] At Woo Ping, learn Polearms if needed for a weapon you plan to use (1 gold before discounts).
[G39.24,84.96 Stormwind City] [T] [A Warlock] Train level-20 spells, including Demon Armor, Shadow Bolt IV, Immolate III, Curse of the Elements I, Rain of Fire, Health Funnel II and Ritual of Summoning.
[G39.53,84.53 Stormwind City] [A Warlock] Buy and use Voidwalker Torment II.
[A Warlock] [O] Short on gold? Curse of the Elements, Rain of Fire and Ritual of Summoning can wait until the next visit.
[A Warlock] [O] Accept [QA1716] from Gakin the Darkbinder in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar to start the Succubus or Incubus quest.
[A Warrior] [G80.55,59.87 Stormwind City] [T] At Wu Shen, learn Cleave I, Dual Wield, Rend III, Retaliation, Slam I and Victory Rush.
[A Shaman] [G69.11,31.30 Stormwind City] Take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge for Shaman training.
[A Shaman] [G47.14,13.52 Ironforge] [T] At Eldrun Stormbreaker, learn Ghost Wolf, Totemic Recall, Call of the Elements, Frost Shock I, Frostbrand Weapon I, Lesser Healing Wave I, Lightning Bolt IV and Searing Totem II.
[A Shaman] [G76.30,51.20 Ironforge] Take the Deeprun Tram back to Stormwind before continuing.
[A Rogue] [G77.43,65.31 Stormwind City] [T] At Osborne the Night Man, learn Stealth II, Backstab III and Rupture I.
[A Paladin] [G49.61,49.84 Stormwind City] [T] At Arthur the Faithful, learn Blessing of Kings, Consecration I, Flash of Light I, Exorcism I, Holy Strike III and Devotion Aura III.
[A Paladin] Accept [QA1793], then turn in [QT1793].
[A Paladin] [UI6776] Read the Tome of Valor, then accept [QA1649].
[A Paladin] Turn in [QT1649], then accept [QA1650]; Daphne Stilwell waits in Westfall during the return at 21.
[A Mage] [G49.56,85.80 Stormwind City] [T] At Jennea Cannon, learn Blink, Evocation, Blizzard I, Mana Shield I, Frostbolt IV, Conjure Water III and Polymorph II.
[A Mage] [G50.39,85.99 Stormwind City] [T] At Larimaine Purdue, learn Teleport: Stormwind.
[A Mage] [G47.44,82.46 Stormwind City] [V] Buy Runes of Teleportation from Owen Vaughn.
[A Hunter] [G67.35,36.25 Stormwind City] [T] At Einris Brightspear, learn Aimed Shot I, Arcane Shot III, Aspect of the Cheetah, Disengage I, Distracting Shot II, Dual Wield, Freezing Trap I and Mend Pet II.
[A Hunter] [G67.32,36.81 Stormwind City] [T] At Karrina Mekenda, learn Growl III. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] [G63.11,74.94 Stormwind City] [V] Buy Maple Seeds from Kyra Boucher for Rebirth.
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] [SP18960-] Cast Teleport: Moonglade.
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] Ask Silva Fil'naveth at 44.15,45.23 for the Druid flight to Rut'theran, then use the portal into Darnassus.
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] Accept [QA98393] from Mathrengyl Bearwalker.
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] Turn in [QT98393].
[A Druid,Skyborne] Accept [QA98341].
[A Druid,NightElf] Accept [QA98394].
[A Druid,Skyborne] Turn in [QT98341] to the Avatar of Saeyleenan.
[A Druid,NightElf] Turn in [QT98394] to the Great Cat Spirit.
[A Druid,Skyborne] Accept [QA98404].
[A Druid,NightElf] Accept [QA98396].
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] [G71.70,61.90 Moonglade] Follow the path to the Stormrage Barrow Den entrance. Use the Great Cat Spirit Statue for its temporary stealth blessing.
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] [G72.40,66.00 Moonglade] [CI280502,1] Follow the den passages under the blessing and collect the Relic of the Fang.
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] [G75.20,67.20 Moonglade] [CI280679,1] Continue through the den passages for the Relic of the Claw. Renew the blessing at the entrance when needed.
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] [G74.40,65.40 Moonglade] [CI280680,1] Collect the Relic of the Silent Shadow from its separate chamber, then leave through the den entrance.
[A Druid,Skyborne] Recover the three relics for [QC98404].
[A Druid,NightElf] Recover the three relics for [QC98396].
[A Druid,Skyborne] Turn in [QT98404].
[A Druid,NightElf] Turn in [QT98396].
[A Druid,Skyborne] Accept [QA98738].
[A Druid,NightElf] Accept [QA98731].
[A Druid,Skyborne] Turn in [QT98738].
[A Druid,NightElf] Turn in [QT98731].
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] Accept [QA98397].
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] [G44.15,45.23 Moonglade] Ask Silva Fil'naveth for the flight to Rut'theran, then use the Darnassus portal.
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] Turn in [QT98397] and learn Cat Form.
[A Druid,Skyborne,NightElf] [G35.37,8.40 Darnassus] [T] Learn Demoralizing Roar II, Shred I, Rebirth I, Mark of the Wild III, Healing Touch IV, Starfire I and Omen of Clarity.
[V] Repair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions. [L64.93,70.71 Elwynn Forest] Expert Enchanting (level 20, 125 skill) is taught by Kitta Firewind atop the Tower of Azora in Elwynn Forest.
[L34.41,48.00 Ashenvale] [H Astranaar] [F Astranaar] [O] Hearth to Astranaar if ready; otherwise take the boat to Auberdine (from Darnassus, the Rut'theran boat) and fly to Astranaar.
[A Warlock] [O] Sayaad detour (about 30 minutes): from Astranaar follow the road east and south into the Barrens, pass west of the Crossroads and find Takar the Seer by the road north of Camp Taurajo. Hearth back to Astranaar afterwards.
[A Warlock] [O] Turn in [QT1716], then accept [QA1738] for a Succubus or [QA65602] for an Incubus.
[A Warlock] [O] Collect the Heartswood from the great tree in Ashenvale for [QC1738].
[A Warlock] [O] Collect the Wooden Figurine from the house in northern Ashenvale for [QC65602].
Swim out to the island in Lake Iris east of Astranaar and take Elune's Tear for [QC1033].
Turn in [QT1033], then accept [QA1034].
Collect five Handfuls of Stardust from the bushes at the Ruins of Stardust south of Astranaar for [QC1034].
Turn in [QT1034].
Follow the road west toward Zoram Strand and find Teronis's body by the lake. Turn in [QT991] at the body, then accept [QA1023].
Collect the Glowing Gem from the Saltspittle murlocs along the nearby shore for [QC1023].
Turn in [QT945] to Therysil at the Shrine of Aessina.
Follow the road northwest to Zoram Strand. Collect twenty Wrathtail Heads from the naga along the strand for [QC1008]; pull them up the beach, away from the water.
Accept [QA1007] from Talen at his camp above the strand.
Collect the Ancient Statuette from the naga ruins in the shallows for [QC1007].
Turn in [QT1007], then accept [QA1009]. [O]
Form a party for Ruuzel and her guards on the northern islet, then kill her and take the Ring of Zoram for [QC1009]. [O]
Turn in [QT1009]. [O]
[OC] Blackfathom Deeps (optional): the entrance is in the flooded ruins at the north end of Zoram Strand. Go only with a full tank/healer party; the final boss is level 28.
Accept an eligible [QA1198] share if offered; keep it for Blackfathom. [O]
Accept an eligible [QA1199] share for the post-clear Darnassus delivery. [O]
[G14.50,14.20 Ashenvale] Join a five-player Blackfathom party at the ruins entrance with a tank and healer ready. Follow the flooded approach together. [O]
[A Warlock] [O] Use Unending Breath for the underwater sections.
Clear Blackfathom with the party; go as far as the group can safely manage. [O]
[A Warlock] [O] Need-roll: Ghamoo-ra's Bind (Ghamoo-ra, requires 22: +7 Stamina, +8 spell damage), Gaze Dreamer Pants (Kelris, requires 23: +9 Spirit, +12 spell damage) and Rod of the Sleepwalker (Kelris, requires 24: staff, +32 spell damage).
After the turtle room, find Argent Guard Thaelrid on the side island and turn in [QT1198] before proceeding toward Kelris. [O]
Accept [QA1200] directly from Thaelrid. [O]
Collect eight Corrupted Brain Stems from the naga and satyrs during the clear for [QC1275]. [O]
Collect ten Twilight Pendants from the cultists when Twilight Falls is active for [QC1199]. [O]
Defeat Twilight Lord Kelris and personally loot his head for [QC1200]. [O]
[O] Defeat Old Serra'kis during the underwater sweep. After Kelris, activate one brazier at a time; defeat its wave and recover before the next. Defeat Aku'mai beyond the door, avoiding poison clouds.
[H Astranaar] [O] Hearth to Astranaar if ready; otherwise follow the road back east.
Turn in [QT1008].
Turn in [QT1023].
[XP21] Reach level 21 before leaving Ashenvale. If short, hunt Wrathtail naga on Zoram Strand or the Dark Strand cultists near Maestra's Post.
Find a party at Ilkrud Magthrull's camp southwest of Astranaar. Kill Ilkrud and his voidwalkers and take his tome for [QC973]. [O]
Turn in [QT973] to Delgren at Maestra's Post. [O]
[G34.41,48.00 Ashenvale] [F Auberdine] [O] With Blackfathom turn-ins only: fly to Auberdine.
Turn in [QT1275] to Gershala Nightwhisper. [O]
[G55.24,23.99 Darnassus] [O] With Blackfathom turn-ins only: take the Rut'theran boat, collect its flight point and use the pink portal into Darnassus.
Turn in [QT1199]. [O]
Turn in [QT1200]. [O]
[A Priest,Mage,Warlock] [O] If you turned in Blackfathom Villainy, choose the Gravestone Scepter; it is your next wand.
[A Mage] [SP3561] Cast Teleport: Stormwind.
[A Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Warlock,Druid] [G34.41,48.00 Ashenvale] [F Auberdine] [O] If you are still in Astranaar, fly to Auberdine.
[A Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Warlock,Druid] Take the Stormwind boat from Auberdine. From Darnassus, take the Rut'theran boat to Auberdine first.
Finish in Stormwind at 21. Keep The Defias Brotherhood, Explosive Consultation and Unrequited Love.
